  (text "CHARGING PATH (design-intent): TP1 VBUS_POGO --TVS+FB1--> VBUS --> U2.IN(A2) --> PMID --> BAT --> J_BAT.\nSYS via L1 2.2uH (SW-A4); ISET=4.02k (~50mA / 0.5C@100mAh ASSUMPTION); ILIM=2k (~100mA); TS=10k+NTC JEITA; IPRETERM=0R default.\nSW_DBG gates ONLY SWD* — NOT VBUS/GND. PCM on cell still REQUIRED. NOT IEC 62133 certified." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 20 0)
